---
description: Keep the LLM wiki in sync with code changes
globs:
  - wiki/**/*.md
  - game/**/*.ts
  - game/**/*.rs
  - pipeline/**/*.py
  - Makefile
  - AGENTS.md
---

The project wiki is `wiki/` (see `AGENTS.md`).

When you change behaviour in `game/` or `pipeline/`:

1. Update the affected pages under `wiki/systems/`, `wiki/concepts/`, or `wiki/entities/`.
2. Add `wiki/sources/pr-NNN.md` for this PR.
3. Update `wiki/index.md`.
4. Append `## [YYYY-MM-DD] ingest | PR #N <title>` to `wiki/log.md`.

Only write facts that are true in the code. Flag contradictions when a newer PR supersedes an older page. Run `python3 scripts/wiki_lint.py` before you finish.

Use the `no-wiki` PR label only when the change has no behaviour or docs meaning (chore-only).
